-- CF-CHG-20260915-247 plan item A3: intake gold set (44 real coverage-sweep course pages, 30 providers).
-- Each answer was read by hand from the stored page text (the same plain text the sweep and Layer 3 read; text_sha256
-- pins it). gold_status 'months' = the months this course starts for international students, with a verbatim excerpt
-- (several excerpts separated by ' | '); 'not_stated' = no start month is stated for this course for international
-- students (semesters/terms without months, rolling intakes, suspended or closed courses, courses not open to student
-- visa holders, generic glossary text). layer2_bucket records how the held Layer 2 extractor did on the page.
-- Four sampled pages were left out because the audience of the only dates shown was unclear (domestic-only view or an
-- online-only course) or the months were a trimester's span rather than a start: VU 272a8517, La Trobe 6fc92661,
-- QUT Online 94c7971d, UniSC 40e4b900.
